{"type":"step-attempt","step":"design","sessionId":"bdaa2adf-4e1a-4b12-ab69-fe46b01cfe83","outcome":{"verdict":"success","findingsPath":null,"error":null,"toolResult":{"ok":true,"reason":"Wrote design.md, tasks.md, spec.md under specrunner/changes/agent-inactivity-timeout/. Design centers on the catch-block routing fix (widen timeout detection to include watchdog.fired since inactivity runs with timeoutId undefined), a shared inactivity-watchdog reused across all 4 loop sites (claude-code main/follow-up/repair + codex events loop), merging into the existing STEP_TIMEOUT→makeTimeoutHalt→awaiting-resume path with a single-sourced inactivity message carrying elapsed time. Verified all cited code paths and corrected the codex test path (tests/adapter/codex/agent-runner.test.ts).","status":"success"},"followUpAttempts":0,"transientRetryAttempts":0,"addedTurns":{"reportRetry":0,"postWork":0,"outputRepair":0}},"startedAt":"2026-08-13T02:47:12.974Z","endedAt":"2026-08-13T02:55:01.709Z","commitOid":"d42ec20f46eb344d22887c28d35bad965bbec1e4"}
